 \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Independent review PASS for commit e1239ba84238f97ae352afcdaa0ad246b6d2384d. Session log vapourific-voracious-nerka holds exactly 29 unique PASS rows with immutable and final citations, preserved Terraform, cloud-init, security, ShellCheck, and templatefile contracts, directive checks, and strictly lower full-region word counts. The independent count is 2873 to 1193 words. Stage 1 spec compliance PASS and architecture compliance PASS. Stage 2 code quality PASS with no findings. Stage 3 domain integrity PASS with no domain-model changes. Focused tests reported 106 passes. Terraform formatting, ShellCheck, hygiene, diff integrity, and the commit-ticket check passed. Gerrit CI remains the operator-approved substitute for local make verify.","timestamp":1788819300142662776}],"created_at":1788570559391450404,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"72fa98a6-b925-4ddb-acf0-570da81b6d9d","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"96c4-bbbe-02ab-415e"},{"link_uuid":"3db8f829-cbe2-48e9-be3e-403d7ae5a263","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"67f9-4218-65e7-4f4a"},{"link_uuid":"836ff305-a1ca-4668-a15d-8bf3ac55c47c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1070-f7f3-c7b7-48e3"},{"link_uuid":"3f3df97d-39a8-420a-a544-9a933fd05d4c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7053-e17d-31f4-4e54"},{"link_uuid":"b87e7b4c-9aeb-4229-a107-389798e8058e","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"4199-7234-8e59-4633"},{"link_uuid":"52e910d2-8686-420a-bec7-c6e71f7dd329","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nFive Terraform/deployment files contain repeated, historical, or stale comments identified by the audit and revalidated on current `origin/main`. `user_data.sh` comments are parsed by Terraform `templatefile()`, so comment edits can break rendering even when shell behavior is unchanged.\n\n## Approach\nEdit only standalone comments and blank lines in the declared files. Preserve HCL/shell values, Terraform escapes, proof markers, and ShellCheck directives byte-for-byte unless rewording ordinary prose.\n\n## Scope\n- `opcert-plan-assertions.sh` — Preserve post-apply no-change assertions for computed values, credentials, usage, address-scoped checks, and write-only-key proof.\n- `opcert.tf` — Preserve existing-host/pay-per-request architecture, SigV4 plus origin guard, exact invoke grant, operator-managed trust list, operator-seeded write-only Ed25519 key, Terraform-managed origin guard, two-step guard rotation, and brief fail-closed 403 window.\n- `ssm.tf` — Preserve boot-fatal versus optional MCP/Jira secrets, file-materialized credentials versus environment values, operator-owned Jira URL/user versus Terraform-owned project, write-only SecureStrings, exact consumers, and adoption imports.\n- `user_data.sh` — Preserve device fallback; volume IDs limited to `vol-` plus 8 or 17 hex digits; empty/truncated rejection; whole-token NVMe serial match; missing-filesystem-UUID rejection before `/etc/fstab`; loud scratch-mount failure; root/volume proof markers; excluded OAuth parameters; exact `REFUSE-DEGENERATE-VOLUME-ID` and `REFUSE-EMPTY-FILESYSTEM-UUID` markers; exact ShellCheck directives; and `$${...}` escapes required even inside comments.\n- `versions.tf` — Preserve Terraform >=1.11 write-only values, >=1.10 locking, unsafe older clients, AWS provider write-only SSM support, and random/archive consumers.\n\nConsumers are Terraform, cloud-init, security/operators, ShellCheck, template-escape checks, and mutation tests.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The leaf commit changes only standalone comments or blank lines in the five declared files; markers, directives, and Terraform escapes remain exact.\n- [ ] Every Scope constraint and consumer contract has a PASS row with concrete before/after citations in a leaf-linked session log authored by a reviewer who did not write the remediation.\n- [ ] Every edited comment block has an independent `bloat-removal` PASS row confirming that redundant, obvious, duplicated, historical, or stale prose was removed while current non-obvious rationale remained.\n- [ ] Focused op-cert/SSM/device/template tests, path-scoped `git diff --check`, and repository lint pass; no missing or FAIL semantic-preservation row remains.\n\n## Verification\nRun the recorded comment-only guard, focused Terraform/deployment suites, path-scoped diff check, and worktree-venv lint.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/terraform/opcert-plan-assertions.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/terraform/opcert.tf","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/terraform/ssm.tf","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/terraform/user_data.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/terraform/versions.tf","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["parent","49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f"],["relates_to","59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","parent_status_uuid":"efe558d3-fd6a-44e4-ba24-099c854c6b13","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"7301-b191-dea1-4e0b","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in infra/terraform — cohort 02: opcert-plan-assertions–versions","verify_commands":[{"command":"rtk git diff --exit-code --ignore-matching-lines=\"^([[:space:]]*#[^!].*|[[:space:]]*#[[:space:]]*|[[:space:]]*;.*|[[:space:]]*<!--.*|[[:space:]]*.*-->|[[:space:]]*)$\" HEAD^ HEAD -- infra/terraform/opcert-plan-assertions.sh infra/terraform/opcert.tf infra/terraform/ssm.tf infra/terraform/user_data.sh infra/terraform/versions.tf","dd_id":"preserve-terraform-shell-data","dd_text":"Prove the leaf commit changes only standalone comments or blank lines."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/test_opcert_deploy_infra.py tests/unit/test_check_ssm_secret_state.py tests/unit/test_terraform_drift_version_pin.py","dd_id":"opcert-ssm-contracts","dd_text":"Exercise op-cert deployment, SSM secret-state, and Terraform version contracts."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/test_user_data_device_resolution_d614.py tests/unit/test_gate_scratch_volume_aa40.py tests/unit/test_check_templatefile_escapes.py","dd_id":"device-template-contracts","dd_text":"Exercise device resolution, scratch safety, proof markers, and Terraform template escaping."},{"command":"rtk git diff --check HEAD^ HEAD -- infra/terraform/opcert-plan-assertions.sh infra/terraform/opcert.tf infra/terraform/ssm.tf infra/terraform/user_data.sh infra/terraform/versions.tf","dd_id":"diff-integrity","dd_text":"Reject whitespace errors in declared paths."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint","dd_id":"repository-gates","dd_text":"Run repository lint and policy gates."}]},"source_event_uuids":["3662cccd-76b9-4cac-ab4a-2ddac9264676","1559505e-e9af-41d0-bd30-ac6878f6728c","fda01d56-948d-432c-a7bb-9dfe253e8cbc","45ea138e-01ef-4522-9630-b0484d0d9211","2582fb3d-3515-495d-b897-0638dfa609f1","5ef534b5-d49e-4208-934d-12c6742f2780","00f28b0b-2d30-4785-88ce-3166b7c0ad70","efe558d3-fd6a-44e4-ba24-099c854c6b13","00cc3df1-bfcb-490d-8537-1ef06fdc72bd","52e910d2-8686-420a-bec7-c6e71f7dd329","ab0e4c36-1742-4869-87a2-0902